'''Angelic Gory''' (天使ゴンザレス, ''Tenshi Gonzaresu'', '''Angel Gonzales''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Gory]] that appears in [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], [[The Aku Realms]], and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]].

